{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/BAREEN.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/ShapeFate.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Astrobuilder is the world\u2019s first dynamic world RPG where every character is playable and no story ever repeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in the collapsing Neon River galaxy, you don\u2019t just shape the world\u2014you live as part of it. Switch identities, trade across stars, forge alliances, and trigger quests born from an evolving simulation of 600+ thinking NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this galaxy, you\u2019re not the only one making choices. The world reacts. The world remembers. And it moves\u2014with or without you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Rebuild_the_Galaxy__One_Planet_at_a_Time.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Starmap_Progress.jpg?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One empire and four rising factions\u2014Mogel, Patti, Nami, and the Reefs\u2014threaten the last bastion of civilization: the Star of Reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your guild of wanderers to restore shattered planets, reopen lost trade routes, and breathe life back into a fractured galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Dynamic_NPCs_That_Play_the_Game_With_You.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/AI_NPC.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every NPC is more than background\u2014they have goals, memories, and the power to act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They form alliances, hold grudges, change identities\u2026 and so can you. Every journey unfolds with new storylines, quests, and consequences, all shaped by the simulation itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/AI+_Systems__Stories_That_Remember.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Meeting.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built on deeply integrated AI, Astrobuilder turns systems into storytellers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c Global narrative evolves from your actions and world events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 NPC dialogue, quests, and events are generated in real time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf1 In-game mobile system lets you call, chat, and even unlock personal missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad Procedural quests and puzzles offer limitless outcomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No scripts. No loops. Just an ever-changing galaxy that adapts to how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Simulation_Meets_Roguelike.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/e.\u63a2\u7d22\u4f4d\u7f6e\u53d1\u73b0\u5730\u8c8c.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planets are living simulations\u2014dynamic economies, unstable politics, endless rebuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategize your next move or dive into the unknown: production chains, planetary upgrades, and factional chaos shift every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/A_Galaxy_That_Doesn\u2019t_Look_Like_Ours.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Characters1920x1080.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No humans. No clich\u00e9s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From sentient sharks to striped tigers and rogue machines, Astrobuilder offers a warm, expressive cartoon style wrapped around a universe of wild species and unforgettable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Rewrite_History__Shape_the_Galaxy.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/RewriteHistory.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Neon River Is Breaking. Who Will You Become?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you lead the revival? Or exploit the collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you stay true to your path\u2026 or switch sides when it matters most?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your story isn\u2019t written. In this galaxy, you write it yourself.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3105960?t=1744271902","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744271902","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/3489e315e5bdfeefc7ae333ce1dd926f3c80a1bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744271902","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/3489e315e5bdfeefc7ae333ce1dd926f3c80a1bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744271902","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/BAREEN.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/ShapeFate.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Astrobuilder is the world\u2019s first dynamic world RPG where every character is playable and no story ever repeats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in the collapsing Neon River galaxy, you don\u2019t just shape the world\u2014you live as part of it. Switch identities, trade across stars, forge alliances, and trigger quests born from an evolving simulation of 600+ thinking NPCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this galaxy, you\u2019re not the only one making choices. The world reacts. The world remembers. And it moves\u2014with or without you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Rebuild_the_Galaxy__One_Planet_at_a_Time.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Starmap_Progress.jpg?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One empire and four rising factions\u2014Mogel, Patti, Nami, and the Reefs\u2014threaten the last bastion of civilization: the Star of Reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lead your guild of wanderers to restore shattered planets, reopen lost trade routes, and breathe life back into a fractured galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Dynamic_NPCs_That_Play_the_Game_With_You.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/AI_NPC.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every NPC is more than background\u2014they have goals, memories, and the power to act.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They form alliances, hold grudges, change identities\u2026 and so can you. Every journey unfolds with new storylines, quests, and consequences, all shaped by the simulation itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/AI+_Systems__Stories_That_Remember.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Meeting.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built on deeply integrated AI, Astrobuilder turns systems into storytellers:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf0c Global narrative evolves from your actions and world events</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 NPC dialogue, quests, and events are generated in real time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf1 In-game mobile system lets you call, chat, and even unlock personal missions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfad Procedural quests and puzzles offer limitless outcomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No scripts. No loops. Just an ever-changing galaxy that adapts to how you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Simulation_Meets_Roguelike.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/e.\u63a2\u7d22\u4f4d\u7f6e\u53d1\u73b0\u5730\u8c8c.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Planets are living simulations\u2014dynamic economies, unstable politics, endless rebuilding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strategize your next move or dive into the unknown: production chains, planetary upgrades, and factional chaos shift every time you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/A_Galaxy_That_Doesn\u2019t_Look_Like_Ours.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Characters1920x1080.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No humans. No clich\u00e9s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From sentient sharks to striped tigers and rogue machines, Astrobuilder offers a warm, expressive cartoon style wrapped around a universe of wild species and unforgettable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/Rewrite_History__Shape_the_Galaxy.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">                  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/extras/RewriteHistory.png?t=1744271902\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Neon River Is Breaking. Who Will You Become?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you lead the revival? Or exploit the collapse?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you stay true to your path\u2026 or switch sides when it matters most?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your story isn\u2019t written. In this galaxy, you write it yourself.</p>","developers":["wastudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3105960/ae084b04f55d3a1cbdb661e6631ec24b664f999a/header.jpg?t=1744271902","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257091841,"